  "implementation": [
    "Hold four directory descriptors before creating descendants. Exclusively create mode0600 output and retain its original descriptor through native COPY with USE_TMP_FILE false.",
    "Require same nonempty regular single-link inode. Synchronize original file then attempt/table/main/root directories before native registration; abort on first error without retrying fsync.",
    "Retain completed files after failure and refuse attempt reuse. All scientific families and receipt still enter one fenced native transaction. Five application descriptors coexist per file; no full-file checksum pass or new dependency/schema.",
    "Operator owns stable namespace and durable provisioning of the root and its own parent entry. Existing archives are not retroactively certified."
  ],
