    "consequence": "COPY normally replaces an existing local destination via temporary inode. Parquet Finalize/Close does not invoke the separate Sync method. Holding a descriptor before writes observes the earlier error-cursor boundary; reopening only after COPY can miss an already-observed writeback error."
